source: crates/pgls_workspace/tests/template_formatting.rs
---
-- the printer writes `limit` before `offset`, which would swap the arguments `{}`: the
-- statement stays as written
select * from t offset {} limit {};
-- in the printer's order, it is formatted
select * from t limit {} offset {};

---
diagnostics:
  `select * from t offset {} limit {};`: Format error: Placeholders could not be restored after formatting, the statement was left untouched
